efl.vapi & libeflvala
=====================

efl.vapi contains vala bindings for the
Enlightenment Foundation Libraries.
It is usable with or without libeflvala.

libeflvala contains additional convenience
objects for applications written in vala
using the efl.

Building
========

Meson:

    meson setup build
    meson compile -C build
    meson test -C build
    meson install -C build

Optional Meson flags: `-Dlibrary=false`, `-Dexamples=false`, `-Dtests=false`.

Autotools (legacy):

    ./autogen.sh
    make
    make install

Dependencies: valac, pkg-config, GLib, dbus-glib, EFL (eina, evas, ecore,
edje, elementary). On Debian/Ubuntu: `meson ninja-build valac
libglib2.0-dev libdbus-glib-1-dev libefl-all-dev`.

Roadmap
=======

Full Elementary support is going to be done first,
adding dependencies (evas) as we go. Later on,
adding edje and ecore for applications that do not
want to use elementary.
